description: Drive the superdetermine VCS (`sdt`, alias `gr`) for history surgery ‚Äî selective commits, amending earlier changes, reordering, squashing, splitting, and updating a dirty branch onto a moved target. Use whenever the repo has a `.sdt` directory or the user says sdt, superdetermine, or guardrail.
